From 3e7eb7cd9f75cfacce7b3e8ac60b846a19094b30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:06:19 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Restrict deletions: trainers can't delete child data, admin
 account can't be deleted
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- noTrainerDelete guard on DELETE for activities, emotions, diary, documents, task ratings
- deleteAccount returns 403 for admins
- UI: hide delete buttons for trainers; documents deletable only by parent;
  no 'Delete account' for admin; show 'Администратор' role label
- delete endpoints return 404 instead of a false 'Deleted' when nothing was removed

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B8r16QcS1qxJdA1TRkE5Kw
